@prefix ecap: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/evolvable-capability#> .

<urn:witness:candidate> a ecap:Capability ; ecap:lifecycleState ecap:Candidate .
<urn:witness:admitted> a ecap:Capability ; ecap:lifecycleState ecap:Admitted .
<urn:witness:released> a ecap:Capability ; ecap:lifecycleState ecap:Released .
<urn:witness:retired> a ecap:Capability ; ecap:lifecycleState ecap:Retired .
